      <h1>Contact</h1>

      <p>
        If you need external mechanical design support for a manufacturing,
        automation, fixture, jig, DFM or prototyping project, send a short
        description of the task.
      </p>

      <h2>Useful information to include</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>project goal,</li>
        <li>available CAD model, drawing or reference geometry,</li>
        <li>required timeline,</li>
        <li>whether the goal is a prototype, one-off part or small batch,</li>
        <li>manufacturing, assembly or material constraints.</li>
      </ul>

